@DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

### Health check
GET {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (returns Bearer token + refresh cookie)
POST {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dispatcher@dispatchtrack.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### List jobs (paste a token from the login response below)
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

GET {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create job
POST {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupAddress": "10 Industrial Ring, Zone 1",
  "pickupLat": -33.9249,
  "pickupLng": 18.4241,
  "dropoffAddress": "45 Harbour View Rd, Waterfront",
  "dropoffLat": -33.9015,
  "dropoffLng": 18.4190,
  "priority": "Normal",
  "notes": "Fragile electronics. Handle with care."
}

### Assign job to a driver (Dispatcher/Admin only)
PATCH {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": 1
}

### Advance job status (state machine enforced; 409 on illegal transition)
PATCH {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InTransit"
}

### List drivers
GET {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### My jobs (driver token required)
GET {{DispatchTrack.API_HostAddress}}/api/drivers/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
